# Development documentation
# ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Root #Dev_Files: instructions shared by all projects. Each game: its own !Dev_Files.
# "\#" because a leading "#" starts a comment; never start a line with "!" (it means "do NOT ignore").
/\#Dev_Files/
**/!Dev_Files/


